            {
                "entry_id": "90d6cc47-239a-3145-805a-4722632e8aec",
                "word": "macchiato",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6b4f6ff3-f260-436f-acae-d7ee54f6f503",
                        "entry_id": "90d6cc47-239a-3145-805a-4722632e8aec",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "macchiatos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c08525f-bd62-35c3-b1c2-731dfdc4d459",
                        "entry_id": "90d6cc47-239a-3145-805a-4722632e8aec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Boisson chaude réalisée à partir d’un expresso, de lait chaud et de mousse de lait."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7686caa-cfb0-4b54-a204-f0966ec69403",
                                "sense_id": "9c08525f-bd62-35c3-b1c2-731dfdc4d459",
                                "text": "Je te le redis de vive voix, ça serait cool, un matin, de partager un macchiato caramel avec toi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "25fae2d5-d75f-49b2-8b4f-2ccb29b0f9c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "90d6cc47-239a-3145-805a-4722632e8aec",
                        "source_sense_id": "9c08525f-bd62-35c3-b1c2-731dfdc4d459",
                        "target_lang_word": "macchiato",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "macchiato",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                        "entry_id": "ddfb8dbb-7ef6-3c0e-9c65-350e67df7f60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Espresso topped with steamed milk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aadf71fa-71e9-4aef-a111-f3cbe2c0b2c5",
                                                "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                                "text": "Formerly used only in Italy and Seattle, it includes such tongue activators as latte, lungo, cappuccino, ristretto, macchiato, mochaccino and Americano."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd617b38-024d-416e-ae50-d72fb144f77a",
                                                "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                                "text": "Kadar Al-Jahani glanced around at the rich Romans and the American tourists sipping their macchiati and cappuccini, and smiled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17c1d20b-4b1c-44e7-991d-7a656f960ace",
                                                "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                                "text": "This is a city obsessed by coffee. Sydneysiders can tell their arabica from their robusta, their macchiati from their ristretti, and have been known to follow their favourite barista from café to café."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1b2dcdf-3792-4fe8-bb1d-b26baa346d3b",
                                                "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                                "text": "Janie and I are having a couple of macchiati in Carluccio’s and discussing Judith Levine’s best-seller Not Buying It – A Year Without Shopping."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e11d83df-21f7-4224-a20e-47c83a42656a",
                                                "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                                "text": "The book’s contents are for the most part the result of scribbling on napkins over numerous macchiati and espressos away from the office at different posts over the years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd61e13d-0514-4bf3-b3fa-78d31a5587ed",
                                                "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                                "text": "Yellow cabs whizzed past, horns blared and people didn’t stop moving as they walked briskly down the sidewalks with their steaming cups of macchiato, mobile phones and iPods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c328c929-78a3-4853-845c-22399ec1cf78",
                                                "sense_id": "c2640c38-3d82-3fac-9efa-b8389021445a",
                                                "text": "Senior Grits will splutter into their macchiati at the very idea that political bias is at play, pointing out that the latest list includes a former female head of the Canadian Association of Police Chiefs (Gwen Boniface) and the ex-head of the Ontario Securities Commission (Howard Wetston)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bf56930-c4b8-3058-ad9a-8139002ba067",
                                        "entry_id": "ddfb8dbb-7ef6-3c0e-9c65-350e67df7f60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of latte macchiato."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "330bb1d0-6c6d-48fa-bd87-72d683fad7a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "90d6cc47-239a-3145-805a-4722632e8aec",
                        "source_sense_id": "9c08525f-bd62-35c3-b1c2-731dfdc4d459",
                        "target_lang_word": "caffè macchiato",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "caffè macchiato",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3692ad3-cb9b-3a45-9649-78186a86678c",
                                        "entry_id": "0d2f7b0f-dc97-3e83-82b2-39e803a688a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of macchiato."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53fd7d07-d2bd-4746-847e-a3f05dc5ed8f",
                                                "sense_id": "e3692ad3-cb9b-3a45-9649-78186a86678c",
                                                "text": "He ascends to the above and fetches double lattes, caffè macchiatos, triple mochas for the Programmer, coming back trembling at what he has seen:[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e4dd3d2-70c2-4527-b955-968879217386",
                                                "sense_id": "e3692ad3-cb9b-3a45-9649-78186a86678c",
                                                "text": "I loved you before you were born, have waited for you to be born, went to that café today waiting for you to sit there and order three caffè macchiatos—with just the thinnest streak of coffee—and to see me and to recognize in me, beyond the mask of my years, the man you have been expecting even before you came into this world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a11422e7-7416-45e9-b3b9-513ea8ecfd72",
                                                "sense_id": "e3692ad3-cb9b-3a45-9649-78186a86678c",
                                                "text": "Riley was carrying two cups of caffè macchiato."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f899beb-a203-40e9-96b0-17e99515b829",
                                                "sense_id": "e3692ad3-cb9b-3a45-9649-78186a86678c",
                                                "text": "‘[…]I’ve had an idea! Let me explain …’ ‘Not before I’ve had some coffee!’ Francis hauled himself out of bed. Ten minutes later he crawled up the stairs again with two perfect caffè macchiatos. Only when he’d emptied his cup did he allow the conversation to proceed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
